# Set Piece

- TypeScript is strict. Do not use `any`.
- Use functional components.
- Style with Tailwind utilities only. No inline styles and no CSS modules.
- All marketing content comes from `src/config/` and `src/data/`.
- Keep components small.
- Build mobile-first.
- Accessible by default: real labels, keyboard support, visible focus, and semantic landmarks.
- This is a static site for Namecheap. Do not add a cart, CMS, auth, blog, or a Node server in production.
